ator-service-center-morbi\">Fridge Service Center Morbi</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- PRICING TABLE -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-10\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 italic text-gray-900\">AC Installation &amp; Material Price List</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-500\">Fixed transparent rates as per our verified <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\" href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\">Standard AC Service Price List</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-left\">\r\n<thead class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"p-6\">Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-6\">3-Star Inverter</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-6 text-blue-300 font-bold\">5-Star Inverter (Best for Morbi)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody class=\"divide-y text-gray-600 text-sm\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Annual Savings</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">~₹1,500/year</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 text-green-600 font-bold\">~₹4,500/year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Cooling Speed</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Standard</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Turbo (15% Faster)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Environment Impact</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Low</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Ultra-Low (R32 Gas)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- PRE-INSTALLATION CHECKLIST -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-blue-900 rounded-[3rem] p-10 md:p-16 text-white flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center shadow-2xl\">\r\n<div class=\"lg:w-1/2\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Morbi Homeowner&#8217;s Pre-Installation Checklist</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-200 mb-8\">Maximize your unit&#8217;s lifespan in Morbi. Check these before we arrive for your <a class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold hover:underline\" href=\"/split-ac-service-morbi\">Split AC Setup</a>:</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> MCB &amp; Power socket (16A) ready?</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Clear access to outdoor unit ledge?</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Wall structure checked for weight?</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Society/GIDC permission taken?</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"lg:w-1/2 glass-effect p-8 rounded-3xl text-gray-900\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Installation Material Support</h3>\r\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-gray-600 text-sm\">We provide industrial-grade materials for <a class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium\" href=\"/ducting-repair-services-morbi\">ducting repairs</a> and VRF installations.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm\">\r\n \t<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\">Professional Mounting <strong>Fixed Rate</strong></li>\r\n \t<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\">Extra <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/copper-pipe/\">Copper Pipe</a> <strong>Standard Cost</strong></li>\r\n \t<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\">MS <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/outdoor-stand/\">Wall Stand</a> <strong>Standard Rate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a class=\"block w-full text-center bg-blue-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transform transition hover:-translate-y-1\" href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book Morbi Service Now</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- LOCAL REACH - MORBI SERVICE AREAS -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-12\">Serving the Entire Morbi Ceramic Hub</h2>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold text-xl mb-4\">Morbi City Center</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Ravapar Road, Sanala Road, Mahesh Nagar, and residential townships across the city.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold text-xl mb-4\">Industrial GIDCs</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Heavy HVAC setup for Lakhdhirpur Road, Jetpar Road, and Wankaner highway ceramic clusters.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold text-xl mb-4\">Wider Coverage</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Wankaner, Halvad, Tankara, and Maliya Miyana with dedicated industrial service vans.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FAQ SECTION -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">Expert HVAC Insights for Morbi</h2>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">How often should I service my AC in Morbi&#8217;s industrial zones?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Due to high dust levels in ceramic clusters, we recommend a <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/ac-service-morbi\">Morbi AC service</a> every 3 months. Professional installation with proper air filtration is key to preventing dust ingress into the unit.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Does Atlas Aircon provide VRV/VRF installation for Morbi offices?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, we specialize in large-scale <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-morbi\">Central AC installations</a>. We handle full ducting, piping, and software-based commissioning for multi-zone industrial offices.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Why is vacuuming critical for new ACs in Morbi?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Vacuuming removes moisture and ceramic particles from the copper piping. Failing to vacuum during installation leads to compressor sludge, especially in Morbi&#8217;s polluted atmosphere. We use 500-micron industrial vacuum pumps for every job.</p>\r\n\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FINAL CTA -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6\">Ready for World-Class Cooling in Morbi?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10\">Don&#8217;t settle for amateur mounting. Trust the engineering experts for your home or factory.</p>\r\n<a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\">\r\n<i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Book Morbi Installation Now\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
